{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Sweet Home》李到晛與《我的王室死對頭》林智妍，2022年因拍攝《黑暗榮耀》劇而撻着並公開戀情，韓媒今日（24日）報道指二人已經分手，結束三年戀情。李到晛方面承認二人最近已經分手，但未有透露分手原因，「雙方決定互相支持，今後以同事身分好好相處。」</p>\n<p>據悉，李到晛最近正忙於拍攝影視串流平台Netflix劇集《Grand Galaxy Hotel》，林智妍則準備開拍新劇《Alike》。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.413314+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:36:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:18:03.859624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:18.335335+00:00","content_hash":"73801641c38f291cd19480d38d1a6f139be25f7469d2161cf4c13b5300507c6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}